      "content": "yeah that makes sense. i checked the CPU on hop 3 and it looks fine, so maybe it's not a processing bottleneck. but the packet loss is really inconsistent, like it's just random drops every few minutes. could it be some kind of hardware interference or something physical like a bad transceiver? it's just so hard to pin down why it's so sporadic.",
